 "descripcion": "The back door at the Route 9 station has no lock. The owner finally explained why the rules exist. The end.\n\nCould you keep your eyes closed?\n\nNarrated fiction. New story every week.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "In the dark, the knocking moved to the back door.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The back door has no lock. The owner never fixed it.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "I called the owner. He answered on the first ring.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He said: she can only come in if you look at her.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "So I closed my eyes, and counted to two hundred.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "The door opened. Cold air. Wet footsteps on the tile.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "They walked past me, and out the front door.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "At dawn, the car was gone, and the gas can was on the counter, full.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Now I know why rule three is there.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
